The independently constructed set \(\mathcal I_H\subseteq\Lambda_H\) equals \(
u_H(\Theta_H)\). The coordinate-copy map \(
u_H:\Theta_H	o\mathcal I_H\) and gate reinsertion \(ho_H:\mathcal I_H	o\Theta_H\) are mutual inverses. Moreover, \[O_H^N\{
u_H(	heta)\}=O_H(	heta),\qquad T_{a,H}^N\{
u_H(	heta)\}=T_{a,H}(	heta),\] and hence the original and normalized attainable observed-target relations are equal. The proof must establish both inclusions in \(\mathcal I_H=
u_H(\Theta_H)\) from the primitive carrier, stored gate equalities, exact-support equations, and dormant-coordinate tags; equality may not follow by definitional unfolding.

statements.proof_tex:
Group the finite recursive response-function expansion by the districts of \(G^{+}_{Y^{*}}\).  Independent-root factorization places every explicit latent-root probability in the unique district factor containing all of its observed children; deterministic response indicators are grouped with their observed head.  Thus, before summing nonoutcomes,
\[
 p\{Y^{*}(a,s_{\emptyset})\}
 =\prod_{D^{*}\in\mathcal D(G^{+}_{Y^{*}})}q_{D^{*}}
\tag{4}
\]
on the retained parameter image.  The selector/context and hybrid lemmas show that each returned observable factor equals the corresponding factor on the right of (4); compatibility makes its recorded intervention coordinates equal to \(a\).  Finite distributivity permits summation over \(Y^{*}\setminus Y\), yielding
\[
 \sum_{Y^{*}\setminus Y}\prod_{D^{*}}q_{D^{*}}
 =T_{a,H}^{N}.
\]
This is the Join circuit.  A missing district factor makes the product undefined, so the case definition correctly emits no formula and deterministically propagates the least failure tag.
